[{"client_msg_id":"9c7f907d-5ec4-4f22-9b39-db9457cf67fb","type":"message","user":"UD73ZNZAP","text":"本体にgrepprgならぬfindprgオプションがあれば良いのかも？","ts":"1634689246.099000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sOEA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E6675214-4179-4C38-87DE-F54FC9431598","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"deno or luaだ","ts":"1634687350.097300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CzM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7c3ef13-f2ab-4d9e-be31-d1a39aabee02","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"とどのつまり、速い何かでVimの補完をハックできれば良いですね","ts":"1634683543.096700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KJX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e872378-d1dc-4f8d-9d1e-b66aaf72e72b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Neovim のポテンシャルであれば Lua の力を借りて何とかできるかも","ts":"1634683436.094900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n8k3Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57e36f1e-71bf-4d28-b5de-0a7cc20cc3d7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あくまで速度を出しているのはddcなので…","ts":"1634683085.093900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FLF7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ff9ddb2-872c-4ed7-a49a-c06db7b74cf6","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"それをvimのポテンシャルだと言えるのか問題が出てきそう","ts":"1634683047.093100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z1/i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bd141c1-e1e1-429f-b478-81edcef54f5f","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"あ、おはようございます","ts":"1634682757.092600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Zz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"143c3ac2-c806-49c9-abbf-59cc89f4ef6a","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"ddcでコマンドライン補完を有効化して、TABを起点に手動で補完させれば、補完ソース次第で十分対応できそう","ts":"1634682739.092100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gr7Y8"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *:fin* *:find*\n:fin[d][!] [++opt] [+cmd] {file}\n                        オプション 'path' 内のディレクトリから {file} を探し、\n                        それを |:edit| する。\n                        {Vimが |+file_in_path| 機能付きでコンパイルされたとき\n                        のみ有効}\n \n:{count}fin[d][!] [++opt] [+cmd] {file}\n                        コマンド \":find\" と同様だが、オプション 'path' 内のディ\n                        レクトリで {count} にマッチしたファイルを編集する。つ\n                        まり \":2find file\" とすると 'path' 内で2番目に見つかっ\n                        た \"file\" を編集する。'path' 内で見つかったマッチが\n                        {count} より少ないと、エラーメッセージが表示される。\n```","ts":"1634682549.090600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"06de1dcd-bd08-4e68-b28e-b96e1cfb1dcc","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":":h :find","ts":"1634682548.090500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"73G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ff8fb15-42a0-47ec-9ff6-59115ef78958","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"そうなんですね。。ありがとうございます:man-bowing:","ts":"1634673311.087300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nmq70"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b1019e1-aa5b-4a63-a30e-7af6932593ca","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"基本的に全て調べてから結果を返していたり、実装が素朴だったりと遅い要素がいくつかあるので速度が欲しかったら素直にファジーファインダー使うのがいいと思います","ts":"1634673196.086800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=WVD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbe6b260-6670-4cb6-80f6-79d446049a21","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"残念ながらどうにもならないと思いますね…","ts":"1634673111.085900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fTI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"868f3c32-aba6-42b6-b8d8-ee6e23b9dacf","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"おはようございます！:sunny:\n\nvimのあいまい検索に、`:find` を使っているのですが、大きめのディレクトリでTab押して補完しようとすると、めっちゃ遅いです。\nfzfとかプラグイン使えば、裏で `rg` とか `fd` とかの超速いやつ使えるのは分かってるんですけど、どうしてもvimのポテンシャルを信じたく:blob_sunglasses:\n`:find` 早くする方法ご存知の方いらっしゃいませんでしょうか？↓ `.vim/vimrc`です。\n```set path+=**\nset wildignore+=**/node_modules/** \nset wildignore+=**/.git/** ```","ts":"1634672720.085300","edited":{"user":"UL5G6QL5U","ts":"1634672770.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+V+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b610ccbe-1389-4567-a8c6-77cb3cf441d5","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"先ほど試して見たのですが、`nvim.command('new')` で開いたバッファを`nvim.api.Buffer()` で操作すれば実装できそうと思っているのですが、まだドキュメントをあんまり読み込んでいないので自信がないです。\n明日も色々調べてみようと思います。返信してくださった皆さんありがとうございました。","ts":"1634656803.079800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lw32"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9eac0943-d5a2-4650-9ca9-8b3f84ad4428","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ミニマルな再現コード書いて試したけど、Linuxだと再現しなかった。MSYS2のmake固有の問題みたい。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/koron/make-forbids-spawn\u003e","ts":"1634656711.078700","thread_ts":"1634638560.054500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"koron/make-forbids-spawn","id":1,"title":"koron/make-forbids-spawn","text":"Example for reproduction: make forbids spawn processes after receive SIGINT","fields":[{"title":"Language","value":"Go","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"a minute ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nIq"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"9677c352-e2d9-4246-8c7a-c22861ab91c5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁmsys2なWindowsでやってるからLinuxだとまた結果はちがうかもしらんけども。","ts":"1634638560.054500","thread_ts":"1634638560.054500","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zBfl"}]}}]
